@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@leaderToken = REPLACE_WITH_LEADER_TOKEN
@tripId = REPLACE_WITH_TRIP_UUID
@participantId = REPLACE_WITH_PARTICIPANT_UUID
@qr = REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_TICKET_QR

### Roster (leader only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leader/public-trips/{{tripId}}/participants?page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}

### Scan current QR, fetched after claim/accept
POST {{baseUrl}}/leader/public-trips/{{tripId}}/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method":"QR","checkinCode":"{{qr}}"}

### Manual attendance (also supports NO_SHOW / NOT_CHECKED_IN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/leader/public-trips/{{tripId}}/participants/{{participantId}}/checkin
Authorization: Bearer {{leaderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"checkinStatus":"CHECKED_IN"}
